stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_member_lookup: query member.members
    q_member_lookup --> q_by_status: WHERE status = X (indexed)
    q_member_lookup --> q_by_discord: WHERE discord_uid = X (indexed)
    q_member_lookup --> q_by_admin: WHERE is_admin = X (indexed)
    q_by_status --> [*]: return matching members
    q_by_discord --> [*]: return matching members
    q_by_admin --> [*]: return matching members

    [*] --> q_team_lookup: query member.teams
    q_team_lookup --> q_by_role: WHERE discord_role_id = X (indexed)
    q_by_role --> [*]: return matching teams

    [*] --> q_relation_lookup: query member_team_relations
    q_relation_lookup --> q_by_member_rel: WHERE member_id = X (indexed)
    q_relation_lookup --> q_by_team_rel: WHERE team_id = X (indexed)
    q_by_member_rel --> [*]: return teams for member
    q_by_team_rel --> [*]: return members in team

    note right of q_member_lookup
        INV-001: Index on members(status) supports status-based filtering
        INV-002: Index on members(discord_uid) supports Discord lookup
        INV-003: Index on members(is_admin) supports admin queries
        INV-004: Index on teams(discord_role_id) supports role-based lookup
        INV-005: Indexes on member_team_relations support bidirectional queries
        INV-006: Indexes on team_leaders support bidirectional queries
        INV-007: Index on generation_roles(discord_role_id) supports role lookup
    end note
